# Copy to .env (never committed; the protect-env hook blocks the agent from reading or editing .env*).
#
# Context7 MCP (current library docs): free key from https://context7.com/dashboard — 1,000 calls/month.
# IMPORTANT: Claude Code expands ${CONTEXT7_API_KEY} in .mcp.json from your SHELL environment,
# it does not read this .env file. Do one of these:
#   a) add `export CONTEXT7_API_KEY=ctx7sk-...` to ~/.zshrc, open a new terminal, then run `claude`
#   b) start Claude with the file loaded:  set -a; source .env; set +a; claude
# Check inside Claude Code with /mcp — context7 must show "connected".
CONTEXT7_API_KEY=ctx7sk-...
